{"3935300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Defend The Dungeon", "steam_appid": 3935300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fate of the Kingdom of Biremo rests in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Biremo is on the brink of ruin, besieged by the Skeleton Legion. As a last resort, the kingdom has dispatched its heroes. Your mission is simple yet critical: activate the 'Ancient Device' slumbering at the lowest level of the dungeon to defeat the Skeleton Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware—the dungeon is riddled with mysterious traps that threaten your every move. <strong>By day</strong>, you must strategically build towers and defend your base to fend off the swarming Skeleton Legion. <strong>By night</strong>, you must brave the dangers to explore the depths of the dungeon and uncover powerful ancient weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with your allies to withstand the endless hordes and reach the end of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Key Features]</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4-Player Co-op Multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is tough alone. Team up with up to 4 friends to assign roles and devise tactics to overcome the odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935300/extras/3d1275b0dbe5891d812d21cb2ffe2308.avif?t=1780398920\" width=1184 height=654 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Gameplay: Day &amp; Night</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce defense by day, thrilling dungeon exploration by night. Experience a unique blend of two distinct genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935300/extras/b4f26cbeb4197b909fa51974c0771cba.poster.avif?t=1780398920\" width=1170 height=612 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935300/extras/b4f26cbeb4197b909fa51974c0771cba.webm?t=1780398920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Tower Defense</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Skeleton Legion is relentless. Utilize the terrain and place towers effectively to build an efficient defense line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935300/extras/abae263775fc38d1ca17cad353d603e6.avif?t=1780398920\" width=814 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limitless Gear Combinations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine various weapons and equipment looted from the dungeon to create your own powerful build. Your playstyle will change completely depending on your weapon choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935300/extras/be6c690adc73cfe97f365350f8dce3f9.poster.avif?t=1780398920\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935300/extras/be6c690adc73cfe97f365350f8dce3f9.webm?t=1780398920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935300/extras/3f0ad0afe6414d8b98e1b3fe0b33e6e3.poster.avif?t=1780398920\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935300/extras/3f0ad0afe6414d8b98e1b3fe0b33e6e3.webm?t=1780398920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the Depths</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is the deepest part of the dungeon. As you descend further, stronger enemies and greater rewards await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935300/extras/39eccf8e2e315d6d9e663abc7256b031.poster.avif?t=1780398920\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935300/extras/39eccf8e2e315d6d9e663abc7256b031.webm?t=1780398920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fate of the Kingdom of Biremo rests in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Biremo is on the brink of ruin, besieged by the Skeleton Legion. As a last resort, the kingdom has dispatched its heroes. Your mission is 